content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Buildings and Structures", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about buildings and structures, you can talk about: the interior, the exterior, parts of the structure, size, color and material.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Description\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Explanation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" interior/exterior\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" inside or outside\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" parts of a structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" floor, ceiling, window, doorway, wall, balcony\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"size\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" large, small, massive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" color and material\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"white marble<br /> red brick<br /> blue glass<br /> deep brown wood\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "The white pillars gleamed in the morning sun.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The building was much bigger than I imagined. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you form the Past Simple tense, verbs can be regular or irregular. You  add -ed to regular verbs. Irregular verbs change in a different way for each verb.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Infinitive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to arrive<br /> to decide<br /> to impress\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"arrived<br /> decided<br /> impressed\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to leave<br /> to be<br /> to light<br />\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"left<br /> was/were<br /> lit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to stand<br /> to take\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stood<br /> took\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Persephone cried.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She missed the greener world above.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Hades finally relented. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "imposing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "noticeable because of the large size", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Those mountains are imposing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about the Parthenon. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "plateau", "type": "name"}, {"content": "large, flat land, higher than the area around it ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The castle is on the plateau above the town.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be lit ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a light illuminates something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: At night the Parthenon  was lit up and easy  to see.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to imagine ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have an image in your mind ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I tried to imagine a Greek god.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gleaming ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to shine with a soft light ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The candle gleamed in the dark room.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "priest ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who performs religious duties in a temple ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Only the priests could perform religious ceremonies.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "interior ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the inside part of something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The interior of the house is painted in light colors. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "collection ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put together things that are the same ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The collection of statues was impressive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le05ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe a monument or site you saw in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what it looked like.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Say what you saw, felt, thought about it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your description to a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I describe a monument or site.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 50 to 60 words about what I saw in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read my sentences aloud.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Sally's Suitcase</span><br /><br />I arrived in Athens late last Monday. From my hotel window, I saw the Parthenon. I was struck by the imposing white structure sitting on the plateau above the city. It was lit up for all to see."}, {"image": "", "time": "14000", "id": 2, "text": "I decided to trek up there the next day. It was a steeper climb than I expected. The Parthenon was much bigger than I imagined. It was also more beautiful. It sat gleaming white in the morning sun."}, {"image": "", "time": "26700", "id": 3, "text": "Only temple priests ever went inside. In the smaller interior stood a 40-foot ivory and gold statue of Athena.\nIn 1812 Lord Elgin took pieces of the temple back to London. Sadly, the British collection is larger than the one in Athens."}], "video_src": "engenn5le05ob02re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 3}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "Sally's Suitcase<br/><br/>\n\nI arrived in Athens late last Monday. From my hotel window, I saw the Parthenon. I was struck by the imposing white structure sitting on the plateau above the city. It was lit up for all to see.<br/><br/>\nI decided to trek up there the next day. It was a steeper climb than I expected. The Parthenon was much bigger than I imagined. It was also more beautiful. It sat gleaming white in the morning sun.<br/><br/>\nOnly temple priests ever went inside. In the smaller interior stood a 40-foot ivory and gold statue of Athena. In 1812 Lord Elgin took pieces of the temple back to London. Sadly, the British collection is larger than the one in Athens.", "type": "p"}], "id": 4}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can talk about buildings and structures. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk or report about actions, events or people.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can compare things.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What do you know about Greek and Roman history?  ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you think that time is interesting? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " The ruins are amazing!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{